  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u_4490710d98baf597f2ed5860_0",
      "kind": "title",
      "source": "Images",
      "sourceHash": "4490710d98baf597f2ed5860bc329cb6ac2f12c648ac458bb6d9d1e451b98a69",
      "context": "Images",
      "contextHash": "be7e2f20129365c2899b2c11bfc465541e61b1858f45bf0248cf99b9271bc707",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_717f0865a00a8d9f0b724946_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium supports storing and displaying images. Supported formats are PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, WebP, AVIF and SVG.",
      "sourceHash": "717f0865a00a8d9f0b724946cbeca130e89a7c1b06184503ea2a3bce5c18ee34",
      "context": "Images",
      "contextHash": "be7e2f20129365c2899b2c11bfc465541e61b1858f45bf0248cf99b9271bc707",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cd55cecbfc1adefe6fe798ee_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "An image can be uploaded in the form of note's __TRILIUM_PH_0__attachment__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or as a standalone __TRILIUM_PH_2__note__TRILIUM_PH_3__ placed into the __TRILIUM_PH_4__note tree__TRILIUM_PH_5__. Its reference can be copied into a text note, in order to display it in the text itself.",
      "sourceHash": "cd55cecbfc1adefe6fe798ee6ea1f52fcb66e47b52c54f229b3d81a3ab2dd5b6",
      "context": "Images",
      "contextHash": "be7e2f20129365c2899b2c11bfc465541e61b1858f45bf0248cf99b9271bc707",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5fc989281bbb510aa224fa2a_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Uploading images__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "5fc989281bbb510aa224fa2ac2fbf69232b22a9737e93b0aa6aa6a6052e3068a",
      "context": "Images > Uploading images",
      "contextHash": "134091da858ebd286d5bd3d92925bc2c9d5faddb7502349e9ee127885aafb2c7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5b17b17880aca99b08b26baf_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To add an image to the note:",
      "sourceHash": "5b17b17880aca99b08b26baf08a70c30cf7537aa2a050295a33df4131de624eb",
      "context": "Images > Uploading images",
      "contextHash": "134091da858ebd286d5bd3d92925bc2c9d5faddb7502349e9ee127885aafb2c7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d69583f7cb6fc77b6e4c4568_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Simply drag it from file explorer onto the note editor inside Trilium and the image will be uploaded.",
      "sourceHash": "d69583f7cb6fc77b6e4c456861e1c1b091b481c9cf615d4e8e11e92526faa32e",
      "context": "Images > Uploading images",
      "contextHash": "134091da858ebd286d5bd3d92925bc2c9d5faddb7502349e9ee127885aafb2c7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_56e3159f9c43190342eeb383_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Alternatively, in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_1__, press the __TRILIUM_PH_2____TRILIUM_PH_3__Attach file__TRILIUM_PH_4__ button and select __TRILIUM_PH_5__Image__TRILIUM_PH_6__.",
      "sourceHash": "56e3159f9c43190342eeb383482874d2050e19e9268aa2ca5c34452bc2353b80",
      "context": "Images > Uploading images",
      "contextHash": "134091da858ebd286d5bd3d92925bc2c9d5faddb7502349e9ee127885aafb2c7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ca5fd35b230b42f8fd6a9f22_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "On the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Mobile Frontend__TRILIUM_PH_1__, the same menu also offers __TRILIUM_PH_2__Camera__TRILIUM_PH_3__, which takes a photo and inserts it.",
      "sourceHash": "ca5fd35b230b42f8fd6a9f221bececaf838908352b484e7c11545f76f9ea8d86",
      "context": "Images > Uploading images",
      "contextHash": "134091da858ebd286d5bd3d92925bc2c9d5faddb7502349e9ee127885aafb2c7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1a7011cc787825bbd3f57c75_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "You can also copy and paste an image from web (see section below).",
      "sourceHash": "1a7011cc787825bbd3f57c75e5bbd48764190f76f78495620edc977aa50646ae",
      "context": "Images > Uploading images",
      "contextHash": "134091da858ebd286d5bd3d92925bc2c9d5faddb7502349e9ee127885aafb2c7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_242e59179321046a1cdbb5d2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Where the image goes depends on the cursor. In an empty paragraph, the image is displayed on a line of its own. In a list item, or after some text in a paragraph, the image is inserted __TRILIUM_PH_0__In line__TRILIUM_PH_1__, inside the text. To change it afterwards, use the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Image position__TRILIUM_PH_3__ button described in the alignment section below.",
      "sourceHash": "242e59179321046a1cdbb5d200d72c1403949091bd2c8a9d936c11a8a278619a",
      "context": "Images > Uploading images",
      "contextHash": "134091da858ebd286d5bd3d92925bc2c9d5faddb7502349e9ee127885aafb2c7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_745390b0b66b29a87fe23317_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To link a picture instead of displaying it, attach it with __TRILIUM_PH_0__Attach file as a link__TRILIUM_PH_1__, from the __TRILIUM_PH_2____TRILIUM_PH_3__Attach file__TRILIUM_PH_4__ button. See __TRILIUM_PH_5__Attachments__TRILIUM_PH_6__.",
      "sourceHash": "745390b0b66b29a87fe233179d767ed242c3b37a9d1e5a55e9d3b1c0ac56a20e",
      "context": "Images > Uploading images",
      "contextHash": "134091da858ebd286d5bd3d92925bc2c9d5faddb7502349e9ee127885aafb2c7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cc94bd0c15693b8fceffab21_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Clipboard & automatic download of images__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "cc94bd0c15693b8fceffab212d1150dc50fe9dda5008133f29ee6307fefe9d13",
      "context": "Images > Clipboard & automatic download of images",
      "contextHash": "ee3cdd4daf6b2d3b815b639cc6e2d84bb300fa049be3644a2ab83cd171fd3f2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f03684d01a8dffff36f69750_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium has a special handling for images copied to and pasted from the clipboard.",
      "sourceHash": "f03684d01a8dffff36f69750a2d005ed5addb98ecc16a2c979c80196145f5b6a",
      "context": "Images > Clipboard & automatic download of images",
      "contextHash": "ee3cdd4daf6b2d3b815b639cc6e2d84bb300fa049be3644a2ab83cd171fd3f2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4ccd14e643c07ccf54698669_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For a mix of text and images, the images are downloaded automatically by the server (or desktop app, depending on what is being used).",
      "sourceHash": "4ccd14e643c07ccf54698669be5a7b9244d952b41814ddb78c35b7b426dff3d2",
      "context": "Images > Clipboard & automatic download of images",
      "contextHash": "ee3cdd4daf6b2d3b815b639cc6e2d84bb300fa049be3644a2ab83cd171fd3f2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_142b8dd4faf61b1dece17af2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This means that the image must be publicly accessible and reachable from wherever Trilium is running. Inaccessible images will end up as broken images.",
      "sourceHash": "142b8dd4faf61b1dece17af29955a7b94e8a9192b0c802f8ccbcfee97a4c4d98",
      "context": "Images > Clipboard & automatic download of images",
      "contextHash": "ee3cdd4daf6b2d3b815b639cc6e2d84bb300fa049be3644a2ab83cd171fd3f2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f9888614af69fa05e2b4e8dd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If a single image is pasted into Trilium, it will prefer the image that comes in the clipboard. This makes it possible to copy images that Trilium would not otherwise be able to reach, such as Google Chat, Slack, etc.",
      "sourceHash": "f9888614af69fa05e2b4e8dd6d187392cbda53cfce443323be3f395a9b5cea44",
      "context": "Images > Clipboard & automatic download of images",
      "contextHash": "ee3cdd4daf6b2d3b815b639cc6e2d84bb300fa049be3644a2ab83cd171fd3f2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3b8ee507ec9241e75dbd6933_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When a text with images is copied from Trilium and pasted in another app (such as Microsoft Word or LibreOffice Writer), the images will be preserved.",
      "sourceHash": "3b8ee507ec9241e75dbd693330b4014f0e283880bc923e875d2b8092a0247207",
      "context": "Images > Clipboard & automatic download of images",
      "contextHash": "ee3cdd4daf6b2d3b815b639cc6e2d84bb300fa049be3644a2ab83cd171fd3f2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c4ab3eb323e7f0a5d1663283_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The automatic download of images is enabled by default and can be toggled from __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Media__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Download images automatically.__TRILIUM_PH_5__",
      "sourceHash": "c4ab3eb323e7f0a5d1663283b768d20075dd8e5d50c4255eb7f62b5e8c588e65",
      "context": "Images > Clipboard & automatic download of images",
      "contextHash": "ee3cdd4daf6b2d3b815b639cc6e2d84bb300fa049be3644a2ab83cd171fd3f2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6d023d26785c3c9d4965dab3_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Configuring the images__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "6d023d26785c3c9d4965dab34562387cc37e5ee77d77014dda31caa43d2dc8a9",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images",
      "contextHash": "d9cf2b71868d1b481d28aeb6efd032dfa5b2b5b7692ffa6e41fe2cd869cbb9b6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7ee1b5aade073e9b92dd7914_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Clicking on an image will reveal a popup with multiple options:__TRILIUM_PH_0____TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "7ee1b5aade073e9b92dd79141c10b488a8bc88b12ea7ddbb6e69abacebe56451",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images",
      "contextHash": "d9cf2b71868d1b481d28aeb6efd032dfa5b2b5b7692ffa6e41fe2cd869cbb9b6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1ef9dd4dfe000dfce578846f_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Alignment__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "1ef9dd4dfe000dfce578846f5ac5b1ebbecdebe6c21915b39f8745d8b87050c5",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6a16a70a1bed925fac8e2f5e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The first button of the popup, __TRILIUM_PH_0__Image position__TRILIUM_PH_1__, shows the icon of the image's current position. It opens a menu that groups the positions by how text runs around the image:",
      "sourceHash": "6a16a70a1bed925fac8e2f5e50df6e71402ac893d1215368afee00537c15f847",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f30c6f2e57c41fd44006d527_0",
      "kind": "th",
      "source": "Icon",
      "sourceHash": "f30c6f2e57c41fd44006d5270771d27c43de4552c9ee26d3eaf601522bd0cd4c",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d579a9eaca8575072adddb46_0",
      "kind": "th",
      "source": "Option",
      "sourceHash": "d579a9eaca8575072adddb4661824a0869e44fab5d947cb13a13e8df6a00e6d7",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7e5693d00d31e38808ddcc54_0",
      "kind": "th",
      "source": "Preview",
      "sourceHash": "7e5693d00d31e38808ddcc54d633fcf8067e96838b6e0cd2da464656d98cc6e8",
