      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4b00baa636b92e18b7a75884_0",
      "kind": "th",
      "source": "Description",
      "sourceHash": "4b00baa636b92e18b7a75884790f0769c3e702d20d8822e708f69ab2f07c7103",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2bfe8b617c98011d6797a518_0",
      "kind": "td",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__In line__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "2bfe8b617c98011d6797a518915032d212ef8043a86b081aa88dcd4fe7f52be1",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_36b7bb9822a06c88bdaf0f82_0",
      "kind": "td",
      "source": "The image sits inside a paragraph, like a large character, and moves with the text around it. Use drag & drop or cut-paste to move it around.",
      "sourceHash": "36b7bb9822a06c88bdaf0f82d5bda37ee3964b0ea1d4b3aab236c4bd58a8f12d",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4b31910e1d896d1328d8a0e9_0",
      "kind": "td",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Break text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Align left__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Align center__TRILIUM_PH_5__ or __TRILIUM_PH_6__Align right__TRILIUM_PH_7__",
      "sourceHash": "4b31910e1d896d1328d8a0e9ba31066e252f1f6bd1d0897c03986f2b998d2e3c",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ed306ba1e65ccf0ad534664b_0",
      "kind": "td",
      "source": "The image is displayed on a line of its own, at the left, in the center or at the right; text continues above and below it but not beside it.",
      "sourceHash": "ed306ba1e65ccf0ad534664bc084139c4362a9cdefaad13c2a73b3eab6dac15f",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_876fe024963cfca6c8146991_0",
      "kind": "td",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Wrap text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Align left__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Align right__TRILIUM_PH_5__",
      "sourceHash": "876fe024963cfca6c8146991a0df0484a0ecbae24b14c1f0ec2acac50fc91ecf",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8e2a4822d3799e243e516ac9_0",
      "kind": "td",
      "source": "The image is displayed at the left or the right, and the text flows beside it.",
      "sourceHash": "8e2a4822d3799e243e516ac93a1ae27743f42c3063541e2c185ff2e42c844fe4",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Alignment",
      "contextHash": "e5fdd37f1bf029824cbecac9e0d66524584ec2db8f9666278a54fd7b7581003e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_61060d6013b00498dbbdcfbf_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Drawing over an image__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "61060d6013b00498dbbdcfbf8de5b34523dd56f2841b2cc76c7a70c571f03c42",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Drawing over an image",
      "contextHash": "5241408f4f705485f9bd9a8be96562fda511157c71bec4c0466f6e857a5542df",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_30f104b7c085c0e54b4f7feb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To draw or write over an image, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Convert image to a drawing canvas__TRILIUM_PH_2__ button of its toolbar. The image becomes a drawing canvas that shows all of it, locked in place. See the drawing canvases section of __TRILIUM_PH_3__Include Note__TRILIUM_PH_4__.",
      "sourceHash": "30f104b7c085c0e54b4f7febf669ec4225316d4a5e07e158dd0575e3a7c6f8eb",
      "context": "Images > Configuring the images > Drawing over an image",
      "contextHash": "5241408f4f705485f9bd9a8be96562fda511157c71bec4c0466f6e857a5542df",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_477142761ea67f8f0c6e2bb7_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Compression__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "477142761ea67f8f0c6e2bb769e56719f608b65c9d7be0ef282ee68e72c03393",
      "context": "Images > Compression",
      "contextHash": "17f9f8c0a2b19923e158e7764c79ec7648be632e3ddb494becb6e40a143266d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b2e533b463fb5120a495227c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since Trilium isn't really meant to be primary storage for image data, it attempts to compress and resize (with pretty aggressive settings) uploaded images before storing them to the database. You may then notice some quality degradation. Basic quality settings is available in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Media__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "b2e533b463fb5120a495227c2c0fb9aac5480fb64be2fbcb490f869755fbe5cd",
      "context": "Images > Compression",
      "contextHash": "17f9f8c0a2b19923e158e7764c79ec7648be632e3ddb494becb6e40a143266d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_14cb9c30aa93cc75ae296251_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you want to save images in their original resolution, it is recommended to save them as attachment to note (look for the contextual menu in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Import files__TRILIUM_PH_3__).",
      "sourceHash": "14cb9c30aa93cc75ae29625151c45975bb58daa526fd0c3775ce8f658a1f6c67",
      "context": "Images > Compression",
      "contextHash": "17f9f8c0a2b19923e158e7764c79ec7648be632e3ddb494becb6e40a143266d4",
